Mock protocol
CONDITIONS: quiet room, clear desk, timer set to 40 minutes, phone OFF and away, water only. CONDUCT: attempt the module assessment below in ONE sitting, in order, showing working for calculations; mark-and-move past 3-minute stalls; use remaining time to review flagged questions only. FORBIDDEN: notes, videos, re-reading lessons mid-mock, extra time ('just 5 more minutes' invalidates the rehearsal). SCORING: 60%+ = proceed to the final exam (Topic 2, Lesson 2); 50–59% = repair misses (assignment) then re-sit once; below 50% = return to weakest modules (Module 11 clinic) before re-sitting. HONESTY WARNING: inflating a mock score only relocates failure to the final — the mock is a measuring instrument, and cheating breaks the instrument.$wdthseed$, NULL, 60, 3, TRUE, TRUE, $wdthseed${"objectives":["Reproduce real exam conditions for the mock","Apply timing and command-word discipline throughout","Score at least 60% to unlock final-exam entry confidence"],"introduction":"This is the dress rehearsal: 10 questions, 40 minutes, no notes, no pauses. Treat it as the final and the final will feel familiar.","key_points":["Real conditions, real timing","60% gate with repair paths","24-hour miss repairs"],"references":["WOLI DAN TECH HUB original — mock protocol"]}$wdthseed$::jsonb, (select id from public.course_modules where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod12$wdthseed$), (select id from public.course_topics where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod12:top02$wdthseed$), (select id from public.courses where slug = $wdthseed$biology$wdthseed$)) on conflict (seed_key) where seed_key is not null do update set title = excluded.title, description = excluded.description, lesson_type = excluded.lesson_type, video_url = excluded.video_url, content = excluded.content, resource_url = excluded.resource_url, duration = excluded.duration, order_number = excluded.order_number, is_published = excluded.is_published, published = excluded.published, metadata = excluded.metadata, module_id = exclude