Final rules and certification
THE FINAL EXAMINATION: 30 questions, 90 minutes, 3 attempts (best counts), 60% pass mark — covering all 12 modules (see the course final exam for the full instructions). COMPLETION requires ALL of: 80%+ lessons finished, 60%+ quiz average, every assignment submitted AND passed, and the final exam passed at 60%+. Certificates are issued AUTOMATICALLY when the system verifies completion — each carries a unique certificate number verifiable on the platform; there is no manual step and no fee beyond the course itself. RESULTS: attempts are graded instantly with explanations for review; after passing, download your certificate from the Certificates page and verify its number. If an attempt fails, the miss-triage from Lesson 1 applies: repair within 24 hours, then use the next attempt — three attempts reward steady improvers.

Calm-day tactics
NIGHT BEFORE: light review of checklists only (no new material), pack requirements, sleep 7+ hours — sleep consolidates memory; all-night cramming deletes it. EXAM TIME: arrive early, breathe slowly (4 counts in, 6 out) to settle nerves, read ALL instructions first, execute Module 11's two-pass strategy, and trust first instincts on MCQs unless new reasoning emerges (changed answers are wrong more often than right). AFTER: do not post-mortem with friends (it only seeds doubt); review the official explanations when released; celebrate effort whatever the outcome — then repair and re-attempt if needed. You have revised systematically for 12 modules. The final is familiar ground.$wdthseed$, NULL, 25, 4, TRUE, TRUE, $wdthseed${"objectives":["State the final exam rules and completion requirements","Explain how certificates are issued and verified","Apply calm-day tactics for peak performance"],"introduction":"Twelve modules behind you; one examination ahead. Know the rules, trust the preparation, and walk in calm.","key_points":["All four completion gates","Auto-issued verifiable certificates","Calm-day routine"],"references":["WOLI DAN TECH HUB — completion and certification policy (this course)"]}$wdthseed$::jsonb, (select id from public.course_modules where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod12$wdthseed$), (select id from public.course_topics where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod12:top02$wdthseed$), (select id from public.courses where slug = $wdthseed$biology$wdthseed$)) on conflict (seed_key) where seed_key is not null do update set title = excluded.title, description = excluded.description, lesson_type = excluded.lesson_type, video_url = excluded.video_url, content = excluded.content, resource_url = excluded.resource_url, duration = excluded.duration, order_number = excluded.order_number, is_published = excluded.is_published, published = excluded.published, metadata = excluded.metadata, module_id = excluded.module_id, topic_id = excluded.topic_id, course_id = exclude